  m_text: 'An active internet connection is required to download and install our
    apps from the application stores. However, once the app is installed on your
    device, you can turn OFF the internet connection and use it. Exceptions: Some
    of our apps may need internet connection to sync game progress, to get updates
    or to get new content.'
